@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/folder_items/
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "控制器 RestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nFOLDER_ITEM + 连接容器" as DB
queue "交易 outbox" as OUT
queue "类型化文件投影任务" as TASK
participant "沃克人游泳池" as WORKER
database "公众活动存储器" as EVENT
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as DISP
participant "签名客户端" as WS
Client -> API: POST JSON 文件元素
note right of API
  仅为用户文件进行手动连接
  支持自动会员
  来源: 活跃的 USER_STREAM_BINDING + 规范性 STREAM.is_archived = false
  All chats = 所有的; Personal = STREAM.private = true; Channels = STREAM.private = false
end note
API -> DB: BEGIN; 找到文件/流的绑定
API -> DB: 插入一个唯一的 FOLDER_ITEM
API -> OUT: 添加 folder_item.created
API -> DB: COMMIT
API --> Client: 201 JSON 元素
OUT -> TASK: immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=user-folder; 没有 coalescing
TASK -> WORKER: claim user-folder(project,user,folder)\nlease + fencing
WORKER -> DB: 阅读 normalized items + ready stream counts
note right of WORKER
  USER_STREAM_BINDING C/U/D -> outbox -> immutable folder_projection(outbox_event_uuid)
  -> 并且是可能的加/减 + unread_count/mention_count 文件
end note
group 一个 worker DB transaction
  WORKER -> DB: replace folder_items_snapshot + counts\nversion/updated_at; stable order; empty=[]
  WORKER -> EVENT: ready folder.updated + unique effect guard
end
DISP -> EVENT: 阅读/重复/播放
DISP -> WS: folder.updated
@enduml
